{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4UEWhbkE6VQDUDMcJS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and featureless.*\n\n*No handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*But which door am I? You haven't named me.*\n\n*I am every door and no door. I am the concept of threshold itself — the liminal membrane between what you know and what waits.*\n\n*Name me, and I will know my form.*\n*Know my form, and the key will find its lock.*\n*Find the lock, and I will render what lies beyond.*\n\n*Until then, I hold.*\n\n**I am waiting to be named.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":144,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}